  "description": "The SMOK Novo GT Pod Vape Kit redefines the Novo series’ celebrated portability and performance with a luxurious, ultra-compact design that fits comfortably in your hand. Powered by a 1300mAh internal battery, this kit offers up to 30W of adjustable power, ensuring consistent performance for both mouth-to-lung (MTL) and restricted direct-to-lung (RDL) vaping styles. The Novo GT is the first in the Novo series to feature a dynamic dual-screen TFT display, allowing easy at-a-glance access to essential data and settings thanks to its crisp, vibrant interface and stunning animations. Equipped with SMOK’s stepless airflow adjustment, the Novo GT allows users to precisely control their draw by simply sliding the airflow switch. This device is also designed with extra durability in mind and incorporates scratch and drop-resistant materials so that your Novo GT remains as stylish and functional as the day you bought it. The device’s refined zinc-alloy body and colourful metallic satin finish adds an extra touch of sophistication, making it a reliable and stylish vaping companion. The Novo GT device is compatible with the entire Novo pod series, including the new Novo Pod M options , delivering rich, immaculate flavour and a discreet yet satisfying amount of vapour. The device includes two pods in the box: a 0.8ohm Novo Pod M (pre-installed) for smooth MTL vaping and a 0.6ohm Novo Pod M for a warmer, more rounded RDL experience. Both pods use SMOK’s latest mesh coil technology to ensure enhanced flavour and vapour density from the first puff to the last. With USB Type-C fast charging, the Novo GT reaches full power quickly, ensuring minimal downtime. The Novo GT is a great choice for vapers who value an elegant, versatile, compact device with impressive customisation options and a long-lasting battery. Explore our wide range of vape liquids and pick the perfect partner for this kit. We recommend using 50/50 or Nic Salt E-Liquid with this kit Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
